lisa-design:
echo v5 migration decisions:
- CORS AllowCredentials is disabled only when APIAllowedOrigins contains "*": echo v5 panics on "*"+credentials, and browsers already rejected that pair under v4.
- oscal.NewValidationErrorResponse returns a self-marshalling error (StatusCode+MarshalJSON) so the 400 body stays {"errors": {...}}; echo v5 HTTPError.Message is string-only.
- Server.Stop removed: unused, and echo v5 has no Shutdown; Start now owns graceful shutdown via signal ctx.
